# ADAMAS reference database (part M, v0.35.0 and later): sources added for the Entanglement Lab (adamas/entangle.py) and build phases P7 and P8 (shewhart1931, mankins1995); and, from v0.40.0, the published price and rate pages behind the Machines and Facilities Atlas (adamas.atlas_prices), each read on the date given (status V: the page was fetched and the number read from it); and, from v0.41.0, maletinsky2012 for the scanning-tip extension step (adamas.traveler_ext); from v0.42.0, ovartchaiyapong2012 for the cantilever process; from v0.43.0, the facility rate sheets and store pages that price the rest of the Atlas (adamas.atlas_prices). Standard citations of classic papers, entered by hand; awaiting Crossref verification (make verify, make apply-verify).
